WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:03.086
- I'm Hilde Lisko.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.507
And I'm a reporter.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.342
- This is for the people
who don't believe in you.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:10.636
- My dad's a reporter, too.

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:13.430
(police siren)

00:00:13.514 --> 00:00:14.806
- You're back in town?

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.433
- Just got in.

00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:17.976
- You two know each other?

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.478
- It's been really nice
and quiet around here.

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:21.104
This is a warning.

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:25.484
- Where'd you get all that?

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.069
- At the crime scene.
- Crime scene?

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:31.156
- When he left, your dad said
he would never move back here.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.533
- How come?

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:37.871
- In '88, the mayor's kid
went missing.

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:41.583
- They never found out
what happened to Richie.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:45.003
- Is that... Dad?

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:46.964
- My best friend.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.341
He was taken...
right in front of me.

00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:53.512
- I want to see
the police report for Richie Fife.

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:55.347
- Can someone deal with this?

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.765
- I'm not going away.

00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:59.601
- I can't show you everything,
but here's what I got.

00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:00.686
- Why are you helping me?

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:02.938
- I don't like when they
pat me on the head, either.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.316
- Young lady, you have no idea
what you're getting in to.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.528
- I feel like being called a young lady
should be a compliment,

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:12.364
but it never sounds like it is.

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:14.157
- What did you do?

00:01:14.241 --> 00:01:15.367
- I'm a journalist!

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:16.326
- You're a fourth grader!

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.746
- There's a town full of people that
know more about my husband than I do.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:22.124
- I think there's something
you should know.

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:24.710
♪ Runnin' 'til I'm home ♪

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:27.045
- I know you cut school to
interview a murder suspect.

00:01:27.129 --> 00:01:30.632
- No.
Well, yes, but no.

00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:32.718
♪ Runnin' 'til I'm home ♪

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:37.222
- In our family,
we work out our problems together.

00:01:39.683 --> 00:01:40.809
♪ Runnin' 'til I'm home ♪

00:01:40.893 --> 00:01:42.144
- Be smart.

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:43.937
- I'd rather be brave.

00:01:44.021 --> 00:01:45.230
- Be both.

00:01:48.692 --> 00:01:50.485
♪ Runnin' 'til I'm home ♪

